{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876300/extras/GN_library_logo_transparent-DEMO.png?t=1739875542\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into Grandma\u2019s slippers for a chaotic, laugh-out-loud adventure in Grandma, No! <strong>In this demo</strong>, tackle wild chores in the <strong>living room area</strong> where nothing goes as planned. Embrace the unpredictable physics, and prepare for the <strong>most unhinged demo of your life</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> This demo features one playable area of Grandma's house, where you will tackle lounge-related chores and tasks before Grandma has to rush away to a very important...nap time.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chaotic Movement Madness</strong>: Grandma\u2019s daily chores turn into absurd adventures thanks to unpredictable physics. Embrace the hilarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876300/extras/Grandma_Extinguish_Fire__1_.gif?t=1739875542\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High-Stakes Interactions</strong>: Hyper interactive playground where your actions may have permanent consequences (whoops - is that a burn mark on the couch?).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876300/extras/Grandma_Water_Fall.gif?t=1739875542\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expect the Unexpected:</strong> From freaky twists to guest appearances, there\u2019s always something bizarre waiting to derail your plans in this living room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game will feature more areas for Grandma to... <i>derail</i> - but you'll have to wait for those, deary!</p><p class=\"bb_parag